      "en": "The LORD’s anger burned against them; and he departed.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 그들을 향하여 진노하시고 떠나시매",
      "source_text_hash": "a1442c1491ce48cfa07e33c9aab49e3585b46f2ffaa160df1300e98d311b1b4e",
      "translation_text_hash": "240ad1d0567f8afc34e9073555b2555539ba30655076bd3b108cc9c0c2b04361",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 그들을 향하여 진노하시고 떠나시매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "240ad1d0567f8afc34e9073555b2555539ba30655076bd3b108cc9c0c2b04361"
      ]
    },
    {
